    "sourceHash": "e5917dbea4b041fc07d5dd27c682b7a7421ea53dedd03afd034a31e23202c0b8",
    "th": "Class features with a choice go through use_resource with the variant named: Channel Divinity variant 'turn undead', 'turn the unholy', 'sacred weapon' or 'preserve life' (the server rolls every undead's save and turns or destroys them; never set turned or frightened by hand); Ki variant 'patient defense', 'step of the wind', 'flurry of blows', 'empty body' or 'diamond soul' (1 ki, rerolls the last failed save); Fiendish Resilience with the damage type as the variant, after a rest; Stillness of Mind (costs the action) and Eldritch Master by name; Intimidating Presence with targetEnemyId (the server rolls the WIS save and frightens it until the end of the barbarian's next turn; a later use extends it); Holy Nimbus and Divine Intervention by name (the server burns enemies near the paladin and gives the paladin advantage on saves against spells cast by fiends or undead, rolls the percentile dice and keeps the 7-day wait).",
    "status": "technical",
    "reviewed": true,
    "reason": "AI-only tool schema/name or internal prompt contract; not rendered to players. Preserve canonical English."
  },
